        "# Asynchronous generator function\n",
        "\n",
        "An asynchronous generator function is defined with `async def` and contains `yield`. Calling it returns an asynchronous generator iterator.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-asynchronous-generator-function)"
